	abstract = {s part of the {ESR} research project 15 “Bringing Sustainability to the Collective Table”, which investigates Sustainable Public Food Procurement in Europe, and thanks to the partner organization Eating City, {ESR} Chiara Falvo (University of Turin) had the opportunity to carry out a 2-month fieldwork at the Departmental Council of Dordogne, in France. From mid-September to mid-November 2022, she collaborated closely with the Education Division team, in the city of Périgueux, to study the Department’s school food project and to develop future food procurement strategies.
